# Copy to scripts/.env to drive the app's data from a Google Sheet in your Drive.
# Leave unset to use the bundled CSV files in scripts/data/sheets/ (works offline).
#
# The spreadsheet ID is the long part of its URL:
#   https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/<THIS_IS_THE_ID>/edit
# The sheet must be shared "Anyone with the link → Viewer", with one tab per
# dataset named: tasks, basketZones, accessCodes, raceConfig, teams.
# See scripts/data/sheets/README.md for the full hookup.

# RUSHPOINT_SHEETS_ID=
# RUSHPOINT_APP_ID=rushpoint-pwa-7daaa
